ORCA_RESULT_BEGIN {{.ResultNonce}}
{"schema":"outcome-review-draw/1","artifacts":[{"section":"","variant":"","name":"","inputDigest":"the input_digest of the diagram","html":"<!doctype html>…"}],"warnings":[]}
ORCA_RESULT_END {{.ResultNonce}}
One entry per diagram, in the same order; copy section, variant, name and input_digest exactly. The block is one JSON object of at most 200 KB, so escape the HTML as a JSON string. No other keys are read.
